        <PatchList>
            <!-- The game's own "-1080p" start option (0x385fa) sets the render size in both places it is kept
                 ([obj+0x3b0], 0x721d90): taken always, with 2560x1440 instead of 1920x1080. At 3840x2160 (and with
                 the game's own "-4k" option) the lighting comes out flat and too bright, and the scene draws at
                 3456x1944: no 4K patch yet. -->
